# fm2-for-hammers.trk -- "FM2 for Hammers", Headless track 3. 76 BPM,
# Db major (Bb minor's motif, Bb Db C F), 16 rows per bar, 56 bars.
# A 8 piano | B 8 + bells | C 8 bells take the tune | D 8 bridge |
# A' 8 piano + bells + pad | D' 8 | coda 8.

track harm note cva cvb cvd      # 1  chord; the pad's four voices
track lh   note vel from harm    # 2  piano left hand, broken chords
track mel  note vel              # 3  piano melody
track bell note vel              # 4  Surge FM2
track ped  cva                   # 5  sustain pedal, lifted after each change
track pgate note                 # 6  the pad strikes once per chord

